{"id": "EUVD-2026-103953", "enisaUuid": "c834448b-5cf1-35e8-9d44-c6dc6023f912", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mac80211: fix mesh fast xmit path deletion UAF\n\nmesh_fast_tx_cache() stores raw mesh_path pointers. Path deletion\nflushes the cache and then frees the path with kfree_rcu(), but a\nlookup that already holds the path can insert a new cache entry\nafter the flush. The cache then points at freed memory.\n\nSet MESH_PATH_DELETED before flushing, and skip inserting a cache\nentry if the path or MPP path is already deleted. Check this under\nthe cache walk lock so it is ordered with the flush. Use WRITE_ONCE()\nfor the deletion flag updates because the cache check reads flags\nwithout taking state_lock.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:46:29", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:55:49", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ebb7cba623d38733d33d79a8c7442f5ea04c0fb0", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0117f1aa189495e6f1ff608681678817995aee39", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/128e800a41270ab197b1cc8043637a2924865608", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/93da3ec938bfdcfb3899428f04c6d0c56fe32952", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ee3aadc43ea69d98f666431e787137ac0badbb85"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98699", "GHSA-5j8p-334x-vh85"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "109f6312-38b7-3386-92de-341855ca4f40", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.113"}, {"id": "317ca8af-1962-3e74-a5cb-d8af612330e9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "35952e06-5f34-3037-9503-838cf7c1c1dd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.10"}, {"id": "533ad3c5-7f45-3974-a688-a54cbb52856c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d5edb9ae8d568745f893c5c5fa3837d85311b131 <0117f1aa189495e6f1ff608681678817995aee39"}, {"id": "55e3867d-0eb1-3356-8773-bcb15bbde2cf", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.4"}, {"id": "6862fdb2-cdb6-316d-8367-7de8f4ad3962", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "687c671f-6177-333d-8201-ac161830f3a4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d5edb9ae8d568745f893c5c5fa3837d85311b131 <ebb7cba623d38733d33d79a8c7442f5ea04c0fb0"}, {"id": "83b3eb8f-7a85-3151-b007-e1117508f3ca", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d5edb9ae8d568745f893c5c5fa3837d85311b131 <128e800a41270ab197b1cc8043637a2924865608"}, {"id": "9981ce45-fc6b-3003-b534-94d2a0faeac0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.56"}, {"id": "a828dfc6-fa5f-35cb-ad85-6b3370be577d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d5edb9ae8d568745f893c5c5fa3837d85311b131 <ee3aadc43ea69d98f666431e787137ac0badbb85"}, {"id": "ad9b061b-095e-3a41-aa57-c371dd5ca49b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "be63a6e6-2fc4-39f6-a19f-dedb8a1fd8ab", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d5edb9ae8d568745f893c5c5fa3837d85311b131 <93da3ec938bfdcfb3899428f04c6d0c56fe32952"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4e2e7f67-efb9-38cc-a2b6-8ac1c4302886", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}